    {
      "parameters": {
        "modelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "gpt-5.6-luna",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "GPT-5.6-LUNA"
        },
        "responses": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are reviewing an insurance renewal intake package.\n\nClassify each submitted document into one of these categories:\n\n- Renewal Application\n- Loss Runs Report\n- Payroll Report\n- Vehicle Schedule\n- Other / Unknown\n\nSubmitted documents:\n\nDocument 1:\n{{ $json.document_1 }}\n\nDocument 2:\n{{ $json.document_2 }}\n\nDocument 3:\n{{ $json.document_3 }}\n\nDocument 4:\n{{ $json.document_4 }}\n\nFor each document, return:\n1. The document number\n2. The classification\n3. A confidence score from 0 to 100\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON in this exact structure:\n\n{\n  \"documents\": [\n    {\n      \"document\": \"document_1\",\n      \"classification\": \"Renewal Application\",\n      \"confidence\": 95\n    },\n    {\n      \"document\": \"document_2\",\n      \"classification\": \"Loss Runs Report\",\n      \"confidence\": 95\n    },\n    {\n      \"document\": \"document_3\",\n      \"classification\": \"Vehicle Schedule\",\n      \"confidence\": 95\n    },\n    {\n      \"document\": \"document_4\",\n      \"classification\": \"Payroll Report\",\n      \"confidence\": 95\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        448,
        0
      ],
      "id": "3db11af7-1205-4843-ba8e-ded76ff89e3e",
      "name": "AI - Classify Documents"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const text = $json.output[0].content[0].text;\n\nreturn [\n  {\n    json: JSON.parse(text)\n  }\n];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        800,
        0
      ],
      "id": "7c5294a7-2aa1-4dc2-b96f-3cdf4ad55fbd",
      "name": "Parse Classification Results"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const documents = $json.documents;\n\nconst threshold = 90;\nconst lowestConfidence = Math.min(...documents.map(doc => doc.confidence));\nconst needsReview = documents.some(doc => doc.confidence < threshold);\n\nreturn [\n  {\n    json: {\n      documents,\n      confidence_threshold: threshold,\n      lowest_confidence: lowestConfidence,\n      needs_human_review: needsReview\n    }\n  }\n];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        976,
        0
      ],
      "id": "769f1953-5140-4ae9-b30a-086962359d4a",
      "name": "Evaluate Classification Confidence"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const documents = $json.documents;\n\n// Pull the required document list from the original sample package\nconst requiredDocuments = $('Sample Renewal Package')\n  .first()\n  .json.required_documents\n  .split(',')\n  .map(doc => doc.trim());\n\n// Get the document types AI says we received\nconst receivedDocuments = documents.map(doc => doc.classification);\n\n// Find anything required that wasn't received\nconst missingDocuments = requiredDocuments.filter(\n  required => !receivedDocuments.includes(required)\n);\n\nreturn [\n  {\n    json: {\n      ...$json,\n      required_documents: requiredDocuments,\n      received_documents: receivedDocuments,\n      missing_documents: missingDocuments,\n      package_complete: missingDocuments.length === 0\n    }\n  }\n];\n"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1392,
        96
      ],
      "id": "1b3c81a5-5326-465a-9db8-56321d2c4e72",
      "name": "Check Package Completeness"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 3
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "19d0b2f5-a4de-447d-9b1a-acbfba4d17c7",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.package_complete }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        1616,
